DeepSeek V4.1 Flash TensorFold for Spark

Runtime integration based on jayleaton/deepseek-v41-tensorfold-spark and
0rand/deepseek-v41-tensorfold-spark, incorporating the TensorFold engine by
ashhart and contributors. Exact revisions and modifications are recorded in
sources.lock.json and docs/SOURCES.md.

The Dockerfile and runtime patches derive from those Apache-2.0 projects.
Fetched source exports retain their original NOTICE, LICENSE, and third-party
license files. Model weights are downloaded separately under their own terms.
